title: "Seedling"
abstract: >-
  Multi-agent literature-review pipeline that grows a reviewed corpus from a
  handful of seed papers: BERTopic clustering, Scopus/arXiv retrieval, hybrid
  relevance re-ranking and iterative LLM-guided query refinement.
